From 3a6766b711abf46c749a27f2b66e6e4aa2f51cc7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:32:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] sysbus: make com.palm.storage a static service

storaged is started by its own systemd unit (files/systemd/storaged.service,
WantedBy=multi-user.target), but its luna-service2 service file declared
Type=dynamic, so ls-hubd also launches it on the first call to
com.palm.storage. At boot that call comes early: udev runs storage.sh on
the gadget's first host state change, which luna-sends
diskmode/changed. Whichever of the two copies starts second fails to take
the pid file lock and aborts. On the FuriLabs FLX1s (radon) the hub's copy
wins every boot, and systemd restarts its unit five times into the same
abort until it gives up:

  storaged[1887]: Failed to acquire lock, exiting.
  systemd[1]: storaged.service: Main process exited, code=dumped, status=6/ABRT
  systemd[1]: storaged.service: Start request repeated too quickly.

so storaged.service is "failed" on every boot, and the storaged that does
run lives in ls-hubd.service's cgroup, outside its unit and its
Restart=on-failure. When the unit wins instead, the hub's copy aborts and
the early call can fail.

Declare the service Type=static, as the services that have their own unit
do (audiod, sam, bootd, notificationmgr, powermgr and the rest). ls-hubd
then never launches storaged itself; a call that arrives before storaged
has registered is held in its QueryName wait list (up to
g_conf_query_name_timeout_ms, 20 s by default) and delivered once the unit
has started it, so the boot-time udev notification is not lost.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/webOS-ports/storaged/pull/15]
---
 files/sysbus/com.palm.storage.service.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/files/sysbus/com.palm.storage.service.in b/files/sysbus/com.palm.storage.service.in
index f79f518..e423ca4 100644
--- a/files/sysbus/com.palm.storage.service.in
+++ b/files/sysbus/com.palm.storage.service.in
@@ -21,4 +21,4 @@
 [D-BUS Service]
 Name=com.palm.storage
 Exec=@WEBOS_INSTALL_SBINDIR@/storaged -d -s
-Type=dynamic
+Type=static
